TART_WIDGET&quot;'-5a4f6ccdb3be09c6END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_UNI_WYR_TurningToIlmater</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_WYR_TurningToIlmater\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_UNI_WYR_TurningToIlmater\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">4f1f5911-e9db-4bc4-8561-35288921529b</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:4f1f5911-e9db-4bc4-8561-35288921529b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:4f1f5911-e9db-4bc4-8561-35288921529b\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Open_Hand_Temple_Cellar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Open Hand Temple Cellar\">Open Hand Temple Cellar</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;19&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-1006</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A book of Ilmatari death rites. This page on The Turning is particularly dog-eared.]]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\nThere will come many a time, o worshipful tormented, that you will have to comfort a faithless unfortunate as they pass from this life to the next. Or perhaps even more distastefully - you may be faced with the dying acolyte of a wretched god, keen to shrink the blasted afterlife awaiting them.\n</p><p><br>\nThe Lord on the Rack grants us a great many powers, but altering the moral velocity of a soul is one we cannot shift on the death bed. If one has lived a life of sin, their soul is bound for a sinful place, no matter their final protestations.\n</p><p><br>\nHowever, it would do much more harm than good to tell them this. Ilmater does not forbid the speaking of untruth, no matter how polite society deems the act. If it would spare the dying wretch some suffering as they pass, tell them that the Weeping God awaits them with his balming embrace. Make them believe. Whatever torment their soul bears in the realms beyond, it remembers not their body - so spare them at least this final passing moment from hardship.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202650\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1351/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 28165/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9521/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931298/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.660      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   43.660      1 -total\n 46.84%   20.450      6 Template:Icon_text\n 41.54%   18